  m_text: 'is an exciting arcade game where the player must control a plane and collect
    stars, fuel, and magnets to fly as long as possible. The goal of the game is
    to survive as long as possible, avoiding obstacles and collecting resources to
    upgrade the plane.

    

    Players can use the stars they collect to purchase
    new parts for the plane, increasing its health and fuel. Upgrades also allow
    the player to launch bombs, which can be used to destroy obstacles along the
    way or to defend against enemy attacks.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d2eebcd8fd4f45947858a0ff872888d5, type: 2}
